---
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-inner">
<p class="eyebrow anim">Free Athletic Performance Tools</p>
<h1 class="anim d1">Know Your<span class="line2">Numbers</span></h1>
<p class="hero-sub anim d2">Free calculators that show exactly where your vertical jump, sprint speed, squat strength, and broad jump rank — from the general population to elite athletes and pros.</p>
<div class="hero-stats anim d3">
